# store/ is the PINNED ARTIFACT STORE — blobs there are the point of the
# repo. Re-include what the global blob patterns above exclude; every store
# file must appear in store/STORE-MANIFEST.json (content-sha verified in CI).
!store/**/*.pt
!store/**/*.pkl
